<title>USA: Missouri lean hog carcass values - Nov 26.</title>
<headline>Missouri lean hog carcass values - Nov 26.</headline>
<dateline>JEFFERSON CITY, MO 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Plant delivered prices on lean slaughter hogs were steady with Monday's close. -USDA</p>
<p>Price range (dollars/cwt) -</p>
<p>-- 49-51 percent lean, carcass weight of 176-188 lbs</p>
<p>	 80.29-81.09</p>
<p>-- 52-53 percent lean with a carcass weight of 182-195 lbs</p>
<p>	 77.75-82.50</p>
<p>Estimated Receipts: 2,500</p>
<p>Note: Producer reported prices with grade premiums or discounts included.</p>
<p>Source: Missouri Department of Agriculture-USDA Livestock Market News</p>
<p>(Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8720)</p>
